{"2805920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MagFighter", "steam_appid": 2805920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4583500], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805920/extras/b631289076366cd52b86a8c5329ccf77.apng?t=1777553931\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805920/extras/b631289076366cd52b86a8c5329ccf77.poster.avif?t=1777553931\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span>     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805920/extras/f58e219bec3819d368f61fe6902bf97f.apng?t=1777553931\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805920/extras/f58e219bec3819d368f61fe6902bf97f.poster.avif?t=1777553931\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805920/extras/4bfd49e4b977f6055df7450269cf17c3.apng?t=1777553931\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805920/extras/4bfd49e4b977f6055df7450269cf17c3.poster.avif?t=1777553931\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=96 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805920/extras/6de8d17d843c0736b3d0517a2b439996.apng?t=1777553931\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805920/extras/6de8d17d843c0736b3d0517a2b439996.poster.avif?t=1777553931\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the spellbinding chaos of &quot;MagFighter,&quot; a top-down multiplayer brawler where mages collide in a spectacular array of magical mayhem! With over 50 spells at your fingertips, every skirmish promises a unique and thrilling experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Spell Variety Extravaganza</i>: Choose from a staggering arsenal of 50+ spells, each offering a distinct magical flair. Whether unleashing fiery infernos, summoning tempests, or manipulating gravity, the possibilities are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dynamic Spell Collisions:</i> Witness the awe-inspiring collisions of spells in a physics-based spectacle. From cascading waterfalls to explosive eruptions, the battlefield is a canvas for your magical creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Strategic Loadout Customization</i>: Craft your strategy by selecting a personalized loadout of 5 spells before each match. With a diverse range of magical abilities, adapt on-the-fly and outsmart your opponents in fast-paced elimination rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>GBA-Era Pixel Art Magic</i>: Experience the charm of GBA-era pixel art as you navigate visually enchanting arenas. The whimsical art style adds a delightful touch to the competitive intensity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Multiplayer Madness</i>: Engage in intense multiplayer showdowns reminiscent of Super Smash Bros., where every round is a free-for-all frenzy. Be the last mage standing to claim victory in these epic magical battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No Story, Just Pure Variety</i>: MagFighter thrives on the exhilaration of diverse spellcasting. Dive into the arena, explore the vast magical possibilities, and emerge as the ultimate magus in this variety-packed brawl!</p><p class=\